      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不明白她为什么会突然下定这样的决心。\n但能感觉得到，\n她现在的觉悟比梦想三后冠时还要坚定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22339b3f909740092b59f4f115d14aaf1ab775c9537536a859d9b1e1f79d1371",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
