    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b3bf4a9b5b1e4b07a3aef0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我终究觉得，如果要发挥这双腿的力量，\n还是应该将焦点\n放在中距离赛事的『橡树大赛』上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17c32e79b7244e064a0faf5b2214f9d3e220899185beec493411f7ac16800002",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
