      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "反倒是在这种能让我以自我风格奔跑的赛事中，\n我才有能够献给您的东西——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f80e4cb2db1807c17c909352a5f73c12b1d409f6ac986c4554a3a921071c0862",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
